      "messages": {
        "202360000": {
          "id": 202360000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "「블레이드 호출기」 플러그인의 버전이 업데이트되었습니다",
          "next": [
            202360001
          ]
        },
        "202360001": {
          "id": 202360001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "이번 업데이트: 일부 발견한 문제 해결, 충격 완화 기능 추가",
          "next": [
            202360002,
            202360003
          ]
        },
        "202360002": {
          "id": 202360002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "업데이트 엄청 빠르네, 내 게임 버전 업데이트보다 더 빠르잖아?",
          "next": [
            202360004
          ]
        },
        "202360003": {
          "id": 202360003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "충격 흡수가 얼마나 잘 되려나? 한번 해봐야지",
          "next": [
            202360004
          ]
        },
        "202360004": {
          "id": 202360004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "메시지를 전송해 블레이드를 콕 찔렀습니다. 그의 휴대폰이 진동합니다",
          "next": [
            202360005
          ]
        },
        "202360005": {
          "id": 202360005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "블레이드를 콕 찔렀습니다. 그의 휴대폰이 진동합니다",
          "next": [
            202360006
          ]
        },
        "202360006": {
          "id": 202360006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "친구 블레이드 님이 온라인 상태입니다",
          "next": [
            202360007
          ]
        },
        "202360007": {
          "id": 202360007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "쉿. 말하지 마",
          "next": [
            202360008
          ]
        },
        "202360008": {
          "id": 202360008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "CCTV를 보는 중이야. 이번엔 무슨 일이지?",
          "next": [
            202360009,
            202360010,
            202360011
          ]
        },
        "202360009": {
          "id": 202360009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "스릴 넘치는 CCTV로 적 추적하기 단계인가요?",
          "next": [
            202360013
          ]
        },
        "202360010": {
          "id": 202360010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "또 임무 중이에요? 스릴 넘치는 CCTV로 적 추적하기 단계인가요?",
          "next": [
            202360013
          ]
        },
        "202360011": {
          "id": 202360011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "걱정하지 마세요, 음성 메시지는 안 보낼게요",
          "next": [
            202360012
          ]
        },
        "202360012": {
          "id": 202360012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "무슨 CCTV를 보고 있는데요? 스릴 넘치는 적 추적하기 단계인가요?",
          "next": [
            202360013
          ]
        },
        "202360013": {
          "id": 202360013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "아니",
          "next": [
            202360014
          ]
        },
        "202360014": {
          "id": 202360014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "상대방이 입력 중입니다",
          "next": [
            202360015
          ]
        },
        "202360015": {
          "id": 202360015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "상대방이 입력 중입니다",
          "next": [
            202360016
          ]
        },
        "202360016": {
          "id": 202360016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "상대방이 입력 중입니다",
          "next": [
            202360017
          ]
        },
        "202360017": {
          "id": 202360017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "냥냥케이크 CCTV 영상을 보고 있어",
          "next": [
            202360018,
            202360020,
            202360022
          ]
        },
        "202360018": {
          "id": 202360018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "참깨 파이를 훔쳐보고 있나요?",
          "next": [
            202360019
          ]
        },
        "202360019": {
          "id": 202360019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "그래",
          "next": [
            202360025
          ]
        },
        "202360020": {
          "id": 202360020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "냥냥케이크를 훔쳐본 지 얼마나 됐나요?",
          "next": [
            202360021
          ]
        },
        "202360021": {
          "id": 202360021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "시간 안 봤는데",
          "next": [
            202360025
          ]
        },
        "202360022": {
          "id": 202360022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "냥냥케이크구나! 진작 말하시지!",
          "next": [
            202360023
          ]
        },
        "202360023": {
          "id": 202360023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "다음엔 제가 바로 데려가 줄게요",
          "next": [
            202360024
          ]
        },
        "202360024": {
          "id": 202360024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "그래, 다음엔 꼭",
          "next": [
            202360025
          ]
        },
        "202360025": {
          "id": 202360025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "CCTV에서 뭘 봤는데요? 참깨 파이는 잘 지내죠?",
          "next": [
            202360026
          ]
        },
        "202360026": {
          "id": 202360026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "녀석에게 새 친구 두 마리가 생겼어",
          "next": [
            202360027
          ]
        },
        "202360027": {
          "id": 202360027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "하얀색 녀석은 잠시도 가만히 있질 못하고, 성깔도 있는 데다가 수다스럽지",
          "next": [
            202360028
          ]
        },
        "202360028": {
          "id": 202360028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "빨간 녀석은 말은 별로 없어도 제법 성깔이 있어",
          "next": [
            202360029
          ]
        },
        "202360029": {
          "id": 202360029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "잘됐어, 평소 참깨 파이는 늘 혼자였잖아",
          "next": [
            202360030,
            202360033
          ]
        },
        "202360030": {
          "id": 202360030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "녀석들한테 이름은 지어줬나요?",
          "next": [
            202360031
          ]
        },
        "202360031": {
          "id": 202360031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "내가?",
          "next": [
            202360032
          ]
        },
        "202360032": {
          "id": 202360032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "그럼 눈꽃 파이랑, 홍대추떡이라고 부르자",
          "next": [
            202360037
          ]
        },
        "202360033": {
          "id": 202360033,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "녀석들이 당신이랑 좀 닮았네요, 제 말은 성깔이 있는 부분 말이에요",
          "next": [
            202360034
          ]
        },
        "202360034": {
          "id": 202360034,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "새로운 친구는 이름이 있나요?",
          "next": [
            202360035
          ]
        },
        "202360035": {
          "id": 202360035,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "글쎄, 생각 좀 해볼게",
          "next": [
            202360036
          ]
        },
        "202360036": {
          "id": 202360036,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "홍대추떡, 그리고 눈꽃 파이로 하자",
          "next": [
            202360037
          ]
        },
        "202360037": {
          "id": 202360037,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "상대방이 입력 중입니다",
          "next": [
            202360038
          ]
        },
        "202360038": {
          "id": 202360038,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "싸우기 시작했어",
          "next": [
            202360039
          ]
        },
        "202360039": {
          "id": 202360039,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "사이가 좀 안 좋은 것 같군",
          "next": [
            202360040
          ]
        },
        "202360040": {
          "id": 202360040,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "상대방이 입력 중입니다",
          "next": [
            202360041
          ]
        },
        "202360041": {
          "id": 202360041,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "서로 핥아주고 있네",
          "next": [
            202360042
          ]
        },
        "202360042": {
          "id": 202360042,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "오해였어, 제법 사이가 좋네",
          "next": [
            202360043
          ]
        },
        "202360043": {
          "id": 202360043,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "상대방이 입력 중입니다",
          "next": [
            202360044
          ]
        },
        "202360044": {
          "id": 202360044,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "사라졌어",
          "next": [
            202360045
          ]
        },
        "202360045": {
          "id": 202360045,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "내가 보는 걸 눈치채고 숨었나 보군",
          "next": [
            202360046
          ]
        },
        "202360046": {
          "id": 202360046,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "다른 CCTV 영상을 확인해 볼게",
          "next": [
            202360047
          ]
        },
        "202360047": {
          "id": 202360047,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1205,
          "text": "급한 일 없으면 다음에 보자",
          "next": [
            202360048
          ]
        },
        "202360048": {
          "id": 202360048,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "친구 블레이드 님이 오프라인 상태입니다",
          "next": []
        }
